# Tags: attack.stealth, attack.t1036
# Description: Detects potential evasion or obfuscation attempts using bogus path traversal via the commandline
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

index=* eventtype=wineventlog (((process_path="*\\Windows\\*" AND (process_exec="*\\..\\Windows\\*" OR process_exec="*\\..\\System32\\*" OR process_exec="*\\..\\..\\*")) OR (process_exec="*.exe\\..\\*")) AND NOT (((process_exec="*\\Citrix\\Virtual Smart Card\\Citrix.Authentication.VirtualSmartcard.Launcher.exe\\..\\*") OR (process_exec="*\\Google\\Drive\\googledrivesync.exe\\..\\*"))))
